############################################################################
## 3.15.0_lazy_loading.patch                                              ##
############################################################################
## "Lazy-loading" PCI vendor:name lookup. Instead of needing to load      ##
## entire pci.ids into memory, PCI classes are loaded separately from a   ##
## pci.classes file the SHORK 486 Build Script generates, and pci.ids is  ##
## queried line-by-line when looking up devices. This all can decrease    ##
## lspci loading times by (e.g.) 2/3 on 486SX.                            ##
